### 1. Check if Space 1 has any reservations (Should be empty at first)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/space/1
Accept: application/json

---

### 2. Create a new reservation for Space 1 (Should succeed)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": 1,
  "requesterName": "John Doe",
  "startTime": "2026-08-20T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-08-20T12:00:00"
}

---

### 3. Try to book the SAME time for Space 1 (Should fail with 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": 1,
  "requesterName": "Jane Smith",
  "startTime": "2026-08-20T11:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-08-20T13:00:00"
}